title: Party Unity Retreat
subtitle: Bring the factions into one room.
tags: party_action
new-page: true
view-if: unity < 85
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 2 capital.
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; capital -= 2

= Party Unity Retreat

Everyone agrees we are on the same side. Everyone disagrees about the rest.

- @listening: Hold a long listening tour with every faction.
- @platform: Negotiate a unity platform.
- @discipline: Lean on dissenters.

@listening
subtitle: Slow but deep. Dissent falls everywhere.
on-arrival: prog_dissent -= 6; estab_dissent -= 4; mod_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; unity += 6

Not everyone is happy. Everyone feels heard.

@platform
subtitle: Real compromises. The left and the center each give something.
on-arrival: unity += 8; prog_dissent -= 3; mod_dissent -= 3; enthusiasm += 2; pop_mod += 0.1

The platform is longer than anyone wanted and shorter than anyone hoped.

@discipline
subtitle: Short-term unity, long-term resentment.
on-arrival: unity += 4; prog_dissent += 5; mod_dissent += 3; capital += 1; far_left += 2

It works once.
